title: "Beyond Alignment and Control: Autonomous Goal and Purpose Formation as the Upstream Problem of Human-AGI Coexistence"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: "Fu"
    given-names: "Zijun"
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22858094"
